<title>INDIA: India's RBI lowers repo cut off to 2.4 percent.</title>
<headline>India's RBI lowers repo cut off to 2.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it lowered the cut-off at its three-day repo auction to 2.4 percent from 2.5 percent.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 44 bids for 66.30 billion rupees of which it accepted 21 for 20.20 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off worked out to 2.1441, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
